## Model card (verified spec facts only)

- **Name:** Kimi K2.7 Code HighSpeed
- **Short description:** A code-specialized variant of Kimi K2.7 optimized for high-throughput generation, delivering fast token output for latency-sensitive coding, reasoning, tool-use, and vision tasks (CloudPrice). Sibling of `kimi-k2.7-code` (deprecated 2026), not an alias.
- **Provider / access:** Aihubmix `aihubmix/kimi-k2.7-code-highspeed` and Vercel AI Gateway `moonshotai/kimi-k2.7-code-highspeed` (CloudPrice, 2 providers). Not in the current OpenCode Zen endpoint list — no Zen Free ID.
- **Release / knowledge:** Released 2026-06-15 (CloudPrice). Knowledge cutoff: no verified public data found.
- **IDs:** `moonshotai/kimi-k2.7-code-highspeed`, `aihubmix/kimi-k2.7-code-highspeed`, `moonshot-kimi-k2-7-code-highspeed` (no Zen ID currently listed)
- **Context window:** 262,144 tokens (262K) total, max output 32,768 (32K) — verified via CloudPrice API + page (2026-10-01)
- **Modalities:** Text, image, PDF in; text out; reasoning supported (default effort); function calling yes; structured outputs yes; prompt caching yes
- **Pricing (as of 2026-10-01):** Paid — $1.90 / 1M input, $8.00 / 1M output; cache read $0.322 (Aihubmix) / $0.38 (Vercel AI Gateway). Note: the base `kimi-k2.7-code` was $0.671/$3.35 before deprecation — the HighSpeed tier carries a large premium.
- **Architecture:** Proprietary (Moonshot AI); code-specialized K2.7 variant; parameter count not disclosed in tracked sources.

